msgid "The Sibuna Book"
msgstr "Sibuna 之书"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"This book follows a request from a browser to the application that "
"answers it. We begin with a railway timetable served by two computers. "
"From that example we develop the design of the load balancer, the "
"firewall and the cluster."
msgstr "本书追踪一个请求从浏览器到应答应用的全过程。我们从两台计算机提供的一份列车时刻表讲起，用这个例子理解负载均衡器、防火墙和集群的设计。"
